+# RML: RDF Mapping Language
+
+.cols[
+.col[
+```
+id,title,author
+1,1984,George Orwell
+```
+]
+.col[
+```turtle
+<#BookMap> a rml:TriplesMap ;
+  rml:logicalSource [ ... ] ;
+  rml:subjectMap [
+    rml:template "http://example.org/{id}" ] ;
+  rml:predicateObjectMap [
+    rml:predicate dc:title ;
+    rml:objectMap [ rml:reference "title" ] ] .
+```
+]
+]
